{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Robot Evaluation Routine</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our clients are excited to add our humanoid robots to their companies workforce. Your job is to make sure they are ready for deployment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspect their mechanical integrity, load the appropriate firmware and training modules and assess their behaviour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Any malfunction, mechanical or behavioural is to be reported and contained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Humanoid Factory Routine: Inspect hardware, install chips, monitor behaviour and report any malfunctions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stealth Gameplay: Navigate the facility and make use of hiding spaces to avoid being spotted when threatened by hostile robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lore: Explore hidden transmits in the server logs uncovering the sinister truth behind the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unpredictable AI: Don't let the robots fool you, they might catch you off guard.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669700?t=1746427751","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669700?t=1746427751","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669700/40085f82fc7d390d8894c45c19bc84e115423a31/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746427751","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669700/40085f82fc7d390d8894c45c19bc84e115423a31/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746427751","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Robot Evaluation Routine</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our clients are excited to add our humanoid robots to their companies workforce. Your job is to make sure they are ready for deployment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspect their mechanical integrity, load the appropriate firmware and training modules and assess their behaviour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Any malfunction, mechanical or behavioural is to be reported and contained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Humanoid Factory Routine: Inspect hardware, install chips, monitor behaviour and report any malfunctions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stealth Gameplay: Navigate the facility and make use of hiding spaces to avoid being spotted when threatened by hostile robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lore: Explore hidden transmits in the server logs uncovering the sinister truth behind the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unpredictable AI: Don't let the robots fool you, they might catch you off guard.</p>","developers":["Cosca Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669700/84cafc234fcd5b1db625c6f86d9d24de15f88937/header.jpg?t=1746427751","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBA</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257132716,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132716/movie480.mp4?t=1745928574","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132716/movie_max.mp4?t=1745928574"},"name":"Reveal Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257132716/55af8b5ccd1df56cee6c0fccc1871a8e0946fbed/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745928574","webm":{"480"